<title>JAPAN: Nozaki Insatsu - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nozaki Insatsu - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.48		vs	   11.33</p>
<p> Operating	   49    million    vs	  114    million</p>
<p> Current	     46    million    vs	   93    million</p>
<p> Net		    8    million    vs	   18    million</p>
<p> EPS		    0.41 yen	  vs	    0.86 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     22 million	  vs	  22 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nozaki Insatsu Shigyo Co Ltd is a printing company with a large market share in price tags.</p>
